#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_app_node.rst:70
msgid ""
"Next you will need to edit the |morpheus| configuration file "
"``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` on each node."
msgstr ""
"Next you will need to edit the |morpheus| configuration file "
"``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` on each node."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_morpheus_rb.rst:2
msgid ""
"In the configuration below, the UID and GID for the users and groups are "
"defined for services that will be embedded.  This ensures they are "
"consistent on all nodes. If they are not consistent, the shared storage "
"permissions can become out of sync and errors will appear for plugins, "
"images, etc. If not specified, Morpheus will automatically find available"
" UIDs/GIDs starting at 999 and work down. Availability of UIDs and GIDs "
"can be seen by inspecting ``/etc/passwd`` and ``/etc/group`` "
"respectively.  Change the UIDs and GIDs below based on what is available."
msgstr ""
"In la configuración below, the UID y GID for los usuarios y groups are "
"defined for services that será embedded. This ensures they are consistent "
"on todos los nodos. If they are no consistent, the shared storage "
"permissions puede sercome out of sync y errors will appear for plugins, "
"images, etc. If no specified, Morpheus will automatically find disponible "
"UIDs/GIDs starting at 999 y work down. Availability of UIDs y GIDs puede "
"ser seen by inspecting ``/etc/passwd`` y ``/etc/group`` respectively. "
"Change the UIDs y GIDs below basado en what está disponible."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_morpheus_rb.rst:8
msgid ""
"You can find additional configuration settings `here "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/getting_started/additional/additional_configuration.html"
"#advanced-morpheus-rb-settings>`_"
msgstr "You can find adicional configuration settings `here <T0>`_"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_morpheus_rb.rst:15
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"appliance_url 'https://morpheus.localdomain'\n"
"elasticsearch['es_hosts'] = {'192.168.104.01' => 9200, '192.168.104.02' "
"=> 9200, '192.168.104.03' => 9200}\n"
"elasticsearch['node_name'] = '192.168.104.01'\n"
"elasticsearch['host'] = '0.0.0.0'\n"
"rabbitmq['host'] = '0.0.0.0'\n"
"rabbitmq['nodename'] = 'rabbit@node01'\n"
"mysql['enable'] = false\n"
"mysql['host'] = {'127.0.0.1' => 6446}\n"
"mysql['morpheus_db'] = 'morpheus'\n"
"mysql['morpheus_db_user'] = 'morpheus'\n"
"mysql['morpheus_password'] = 'morpheusDbUserPassword'\n"
"user['uid'] = 899\n"
"user['gid'] = 899\n"
